    "detailed_description": "<strong> YOUR DUNGEON IS UNDER ATTACK! </strong><br><br>A horde of heroes from a nearby castle is on their way to ransack your dungeon. Build traps and employ mobs to defend your treasure.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063800/extras/96cecb65db8265fed8ab19f815b1cb49.poster.avif?t=1657422887\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063800/extras/96cecb65db8265fed8ab19f815b1cb49.webm?t=1657422887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063800/extras/96cecb65db8265fed8ab19f815b1cb49.mp4?t=1657422887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Dungems is a mix of tactics and tower defence. Invading heroes from nearby castles will try and outwit your dungeon designs - using spells, charms and shields to get around your obstacles...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063800/extras/2ad52cc46bb96dc65ed6acd497ebe8e0.poster.avif?t=1657422887\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063800/extras/2ad52cc46bb96dc65ed6acd497ebe8e0.webm?t=1657422887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063800/extras/2ad52cc46bb96dc65ed6acd497ebe8e0.mp4?t=1657422887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Outwit the heroes to keep you treasure intact.  Use the bones of fallen enemies to unlock tower packs and upgrades.  Use these upgrades to take on even bigger hordes of heroes. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063800/extras/696977cdb3b0af1041da308b0f74a144.poster.avif?t=1657422887\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063800/extras/696977cdb3b0af1041da308b0f74a144.webm?t=1657422887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063800/extras/696977cdb3b0af1041da308b0f74a144.mp4?t=1657422887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Create a perfect deck of monsters and mechanical traps - pick the right pieces to show your enemy you are the real boss.<br><br><strong>FEATURES </strong><br>\ud83c\udff9  Six different upgradable towers - each tower with it's own individual tech tree <br>\ud83d\udd28  Five unique mobs - each with their own unique characteristics and available to assist you in your defence <br>\ud83d\udc80  Complete objectives and earn enough gold to attract bosses into your dungeon<br>\ud83c\udccf  Build a deck of the perfect traps &amp; mobs to defend your dungeon<br>\ud83c\udfb2  Twenty-five waves of madness over five unique and expandable dungeons<br>\ud83e\udd60 Battle and build against unique hero's with special abilities <br><br><strong>LIFECYCLE</strong><br>The game is a work in progress. Made with a lot of love and mistakes.<br><br>If you like (or dislike) the game - please leave us some feedback!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong> YOUR DUNGEON IS UNDER ATTACK! </strong><br><br>A horde of heroes from a nearby castle is on their way to ransack your dungeon. Build traps and employ mobs to defend your treasure.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063800/extras/96cecb65db8265fed8ab19f815b1cb49.poster.avif?t=1657422887\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063800/extras/96cecb65db8265fed8ab19f815b1cb49.webm?t=1657422887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063800/extras/96cecb65db8265fed8ab19f815b1cb49.mp4?t=1657422887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Dungems is a mix of tactics and tower defence. Invading heroes from nearby castles will try and outwit your dungeon designs - using spells, charms and shields to get around your obstacles...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063800/extras/2ad52cc46bb96dc65ed6acd497ebe8e0.poster.avif?t=1657422887\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063800/extras/2ad52cc46bb96dc65ed6acd497ebe8e0.webm?t=1657422887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063800/extras/2ad52cc46bb96dc65ed6acd497ebe8e0.mp4?t=1657422887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Outwit the heroes to keep you treasure intact.  Use the bones of fallen enemies to unlock tower packs and upgrades.  Use these upgrades to take on even bigger hordes of heroes. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063800/extras/696977cdb3b0af1041da308b0f74a144.poster.avif?t=1657422887\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063800/extras/696977cdb3b0af1041da308b0f74a144.webm?t=1657422887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063800/extras/696977cdb3b0af1041da308b0f74a144.mp4?t=1657422887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Create a perfect deck of monsters and mechanical traps - pick the right pieces to show your enemy you are the real boss.<br><br><strong>FEATURES </strong><br>\ud83c\udff9  Six different upgradable towers - each tower with it's own individual tech tree <br>\ud83d\udd28  Five unique mobs - each with their own unique characteristics and available to assist you in your defence <br>\ud83d\udc80  Complete objectives and earn enough gold to attract bosses into your dungeon<br>\ud83c\udccf  Build a deck of the perfect traps &amp; mobs to defend your dungeon<br>\ud83c\udfb2  Twenty-five waves of madness over five unique and expandable dungeons<br>\ud83e\udd60 Battle and build against unique hero's with special abilities <br><br><strong>LIFECYCLE</strong><br>The game is a work in progress. Made with a lot of love and mistakes.<br><br>If you like (or dislike) the game - please leave us some feedback!",
